flowchart TB
  Track[Existing catalog track] --> Contain{Source under accepted root?}
  Contain -->|no| Error[Report per-track error]
  Contain -->|yes| BPM[Use known BPM or estimate missing value]
  BPM --> Target[Compute deterministic primary destination]
  Target --> Primary[Verified primary copy; retain original]
  Primary --> Extra[Verify all configured extra copies]
  Extra -->|success| Update[Update same track ID / path / hash / BPM]
  Update --> Commit[Commit this track]
  Extra -->|failure| Rollback[Rollback row; retain created copies]
  Commit --> Next[Next catalog track]
  Rollback --> Next
